sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin
    participant Sec as Spring Security
    participant R as AdminResource
    participant DS as DatasourceService
    participant Repo as RepositoryDatasourceManager / repository
    participant CM as ConnectionManager
    participant Factory as SaikuConnectionFactory
    participant DW as Data Warehouse
    Admin->>Sec: GET /rest/saiku/admin/datasources/{id}/refresh
    Sec->>R: exige usuario admin
    R->>DS: refresh datasource
    DS->>Repo: resolver definición persistida
    DS->>CM: refreshConnection(id)
    CM->>Factory: crear/reemplazar backend
    Factory->>DW: abrir conexión
    DW-->>CM: conexión o fallo
    CM-->>R: estado del refresh
    R-->>Admin: respuesta HTTP
